      "title": "Price target increased by 8.8% to ₹808",
      "body": "Up from ₹743, the current price target is an average from 2 analysts. New target price is 40% above last closing price of ₹578. Stock is up 4.6% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹42.60 for next year compared to ₹34.18 last year.",
