      "date": "2026-02-01T18:08:00.000Z",
      "title": "Now 22% overvalued",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has fallen 3.5% to ₹527. The fair value is estimated to be ₹433, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 7.5% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 17%. Revenue is forecast to grow by 17% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to grow by 10% in the next 2 years.",
